  "instructions": [
    "preheat the oven to 425f (220c).",
    "in a large bowl, whisk together coriander, ginger, lemon juice, olive oil, salt, and pepper.",
    "add chicken to the bowl and toss to coat with the spice mixture.",
    "spread the chicken mixture in a single layer on a large baking sheet.",
    "roast in the preheated oven for 25 minutes.",
    "remove the chicken from the oven and stir in the chopped onion, garlic, and dates.",
    "return to the oven and roast for an additional 10-12 minutes.",
    "remove from the oven and stir in the coconut sugar, beurre monte, and chicken broth.",
    "reduce heat to 350f (180c) and simmer on the stovetop for 5 minutes.",
    "taste and adjust seasonings as needed.",
    "serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley."
  ],
